                "metadata": {
                    "category": "stories",
                    "description": "Enter a dress-making contest with the most fashionable unicorn in all of Sparkledonia, attend Unicorn Boarding School with Goldy the Unpredictable, befriend a mermicorn with Greta, help Sasha pet-sit for a finned companion, and race across a rainbow with Gigi the bear cub… on the backs of her unicorn friends!",
